 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "arr is a list of n positive integers, state a string of n characters \"0\"/\"1\" with at least one \"1\", and m a positive integer. S starts empty. Each of m operations appends arr[i] for some currently available index i (an index may be chosen again later); afterwards every blocked index whose left neighbour was available before this operation becomes available. Return the lexicographically largest S that can be produced (a list of m integers).",
